memechanic":1,"boardgameexpansion":0,"boardgameversion":7,"expandsboardgame":0,"boardgameintegration":0,"contains":0,"containedin":0,"reimplementation":0,"reimplements":0,"boardgamefamily":6,"videogamebg":0,"boardgamesubdomain":1,"boardgameaccessory":0,"cardset":0},"secondarynamescount":0,"alternatenamescount":6,"primaryname":{"nameid":"2096227","name":"EXIT: The Game \u2013 Advent Calendar: The Hunt for the Golden Book","sortindex":"1","primaryname":"1","translit":"EXIT: The Game - Advent Calendar: The Hunt for the Golden Book"},"alternatenames":[{"nameid":"2020289","name":"EXIT: Das Spiel \u2013 Adventskalender: Die Jagd nach dem goldenen Buch"},{"nameid":"2369089","name":"EXIT: Het Spel \u2013 Adventskalender: De jacht op het gouden boek"},{"nameid":"2642356","name":"EXIT: Het Spel \u2013 Adventskalender: De zoektocht naar het gouden boek"},{"nameid":"2549931","name":"EXIT: Julekalender \u2013 Jagten p\u00e5 den gyldne bog"},{"nameid":"2311852","name":"EXIT: Le Jeu \u2013 Calendrier de l'avant: A la poursuite du livre d'or"},{"nameid":"2327761","name":"EXIT: The Game \u2013 Adventskalender: Jakten p\u00e5 den gyllene boken"}],"description":"<p>Oh no! Something terrible has happened: Santa Claus' golden book has disappeared! It contained a complete list of all the Christmas wishes. If the book isn't found by Christmas Eve, there will be nothing but sad faces around the tree on Christmas morning. It is up to you to save Christmas &mdash; and time is of the essence!<\/p>\n\n<p>The thief's trail leads you to a remote mountain village. You quickly notice that something strange is afoot here...but what? And where has the golden book gone? You must find it, but let me tell you: Behind the doors of this village there are many surprises waiting for you!<\/p>\n\n<p><em><strong>Exit: The Game &ndash; Advent Calendar: The Hunt for the Golden Book<\/strong><\/em> is an EXIT game and a 24-part adventure story in one. To find the golden book, you must open a little calendar door every day. Behind each, you will find a new exciting puzzle, the solution of which will help you to move onto the next room. Only if you follow the clues and solve all 24 puzzles will you find the thief and the book...and save Christmas.<\/p>\n\n<p>Level: Beginner<\/p>\n\n","wiki":"<span class='text-muted'>This page does not exist. You can edit this page to create it.<\/span>","website":{"url":"https:\/\/store.thamesandkosmos.com\/collections\/board-games\/products\/exit-advent-calendar-the-hunt-for-the-golden-book","title":"Exit: The Game \u2013 Advent Calendar: The Hunt for the Golden Book"},"imageid":"6632318","images":{"thumb":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__small\/img\/IWoGQDOs60xPPLUZ2qAqR61wEck=\/fit-in\/200x150\/filters:strip_icc()\/pic6632318.jpg","micro":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__micro\/img\/_Rn_V6EXo5spZoHVWVf7lmY04Fc=\/fit-in\/64x64\/filters:strip_icc()\/pic6632318.jpg","square":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__square\/img\/COVPPzW28NBgnrgdEFilp0yVQM8=\/75x75\/filters:strip_icc()\/pic6632318.jpg","tallthumb":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__tallthumb\/img\/p-3PF_m4rcs5MDL5fISsJU7acuY=\/fit-in\/75x125\/filters:strip_icc()\/pic6632318.jpg","previewthumb":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__previewthumb\/img\/uuGsiV6mOfHpfoQwAtiiT06NHAw=\/fit-in\/300x320\/filters:strip_icc()\/pic6632318.jpg","square200":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__square200\/img\/3gT_4uigSvkyTqsFWlzKW38VoxM=\/200x200\/filters:strip_icc()\/pic6632318.jpg","original":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__original\/img\/xNfizYi4f6A9VbmPO2FDZ_Gk-wM=\/0x0\/filters:format(jpeg)\/pic6632318.jpg"},"imagepagehref":"\/image\/6632318\/exit-the-game-advent-calendar-the-hunt-for-the-gol","imageurl":"https:\/\/cf.geekdo-images.com\/nNVkEVfayrcrfOzFs_14Bw__itemrep\/img\/K6nTUH3Zg8wfvpKYTZAERcqPz6Y=\/fit-in\/246x300\/filters:strip_icc